  "summary": {
    "title": "Lab3 Small WLAN",
    "owner": "Bukari Samuel Amoako",
    "description": "A small home/office WLAN consisting of one modem, one Wi-Fi router/access point, two laptops, one smartphone, a network printer and a NAS file server, connected to the Internet via an ISP.\n\nAssets: router/AP, router firmware and configuration, router admin credentials, Wi-Fi passphrase, client devices, NAS and stored files, user data and credentials, network traffic, and the Internet connection.\n\nAssumptions: WPA2-PSK is used with a single shared passphrase, all users share one SSID, and the router uses default settings unless stated otherwise.",
    "id": 0
  },
